Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:03.81,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What a lively crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:09.76,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,The Farsas king's birthday is now an annual \Nevent where we welcome foreign diplomats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:12.58,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Apologies in advance for all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:14.36,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I knew what I was getting into.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:19.20,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:24.16,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Let me see your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.43,0:00:30.24,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,This is a magic implement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:32.37,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It can be used once by sliding the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.37,0:00:36.93,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,which will prevent any teleportation \Nmagic in your immediate surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:40.73,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,After the hard time we had in that fight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:45.13,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Teleportation and flight can be a real hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:47.26,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Will it stop you from teleporting, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:48.60,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:52.51,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I created it to stop even those with \Npowers comparable to a witch's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.73,0:00:55.91,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:01.32,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:03.08,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Is something funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:05.62,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, of course that's your gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:08.00,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:09.83,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:46.02,Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}~ Half of Eternity ~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:55.11,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Pleased to make your \Nacquaintances, Your Majesties.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:02:59.58,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,My name is Aurelia Canao Naysha Faurecia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:05.08,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,I come here from Gandona in place \Nof our king to offer his congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:07.76,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Thank you for the courteous introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.54,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Please send the king my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:12.69,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Why, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:14.25,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Hey, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:15.96,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Travis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:18.13,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:20.62,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Hey, show some prudence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:23.09,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I'm here as her guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:32.98,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I'd like you to serve \Nas a stand-in for my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:34.69,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,A stand-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:38.75,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,A pesky woman might show up \Nto try and kill Aurelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:44.03,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,We don't want her underlings to come \Nhere while I make my way to go kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:46.75,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,So for the time being, \Nyou'll be my girl instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:47.66,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:49.56,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't I get a say in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:53.37,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,By the way, what's this pesky woman like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:55.08,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,She's just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.54,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You mean she's got a nasty personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:03:58.73,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.73,0:04:00.80,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I mean in terms of rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.59,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,She's a demon queen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:05.94,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Anyway, you don't get to say no here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:07.47,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:10.68,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,If you cooperate, I promise \Nthat both Farsas and Tuldarr,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:15.19,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,as long as your bloodline lives on, \Nwill be free of my aggression.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:21.11,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Be it one country or two, \Nit's all the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:26.57,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What is your relationship with Aurelia?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:28.89,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Huh? Nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.89,0:04:30.64,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I've just taken a liking to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.37,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,She's still a child, so it'd be \Na shame if she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:37.79,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,So will you do it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:40.03,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,F-Fine, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:42.70,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Blossom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:47.50,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,This sign proves you're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:49.64,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Any demon would recognize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.21,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.62,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,I'll check her dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:57.48,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:01.96,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Seriously, when did she manage to sneak out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:05.53,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Queen Tinasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.49,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:20.84,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,It's not someone's missing child, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.02,0:05:26.64,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:38.37,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:40.26,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.79,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.26,0:05:49.76,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Th-The letter! The letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:49.76,Default-Top,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:51.78,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Y-You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:54.24,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha. I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:03.81,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,"This infant is the king's child."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:05.63,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,"Please raise him well."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:06.76,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:08.59,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That's not my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.59,0:06:10.36,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Th-That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:12.89,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,His Majesty would never be so foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:16.42,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Do the two of you think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:19.56,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,There's no way the math would work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:21.15,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:24.50,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,It's been two months since \NQueen Tinasha lifted the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:26.18,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,There hasn't been enough time...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:29.53,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Um, so in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:31.10,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,An abandoned child?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:32.99,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Do you know who could have done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:34.07,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:36.44,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I don't recognize the handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:38.63,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,And there's no name given here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:41.96,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Well, we can keep an eye \Non him in Farsas for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:46.13,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,The mother might change her mind \Nand come back for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.13,0:06:47.17,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.59,0:06:51.26,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:54.31,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I have an errand to run, so I'll be leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:56.13,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That sure is sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:57.28,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:06:59.64,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:02.66,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,At Lazar's mindless comments just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:05.35,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:07.49,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:08.69,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Which is why I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:10.18,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:11.16,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.28,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.60,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:17.22,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Something's bugging me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:22.57,Flashback,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Lanak?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.45,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:30.67,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:34.82,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,I had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.75,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,A dream where I got stabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:40.86,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,You saw into her memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.61,0:07:42.73,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I'll get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:45.54,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,They're not good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:48.62,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Aurelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:49.61,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.33,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I'll be away from the mansion for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.33,0:07:56.12,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,If any strangers come by asking for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:58.74,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,tell them I've taken a liking to that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:02.81,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,By "that woman," you\N mean the queen of Tuldarr?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.36,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:06.75,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Don't you dare leave this mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.75,0:08:08.80,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:11.94,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:15.16,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,What kind of woman is the puppet this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:17.97,Default,Taviti,0,0,0,,She's a powerful mage, for a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.97,0:08:18.97,Default,Taviti,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:21.98,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)}Phaedra    {\fs14}Higher Demon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:21.85,Default-Top,Taviti,0,0,0,,Twelve of our kind serve her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:26.06,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,Nothing more than scum, serving a lowly insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.16,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,What disgraces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.78,0:08:30.63,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,Should we end their lives while we're at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:32.24,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Before you can do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:34.96,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I'll end yours first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:36.41,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,Travis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.49,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,You came all this way for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:42.25,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,It's about time you stop \Nfollowing me around, Phaedra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:46.42,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I'm done giving you the time of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:56.47,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I've sealed off your escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.89,0:08:58.49,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Come out, Phaedra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:06.81,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,What's the big idea, Taviti?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:08.52,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Where did Phaedra go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.99,Default,Taviti,0,0,0,,She's descended to the human realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:13.49,Default,Taviti,0,0,0,,You're up against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:15.74,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:19.95,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Well, she can handle it herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:23.38,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Phaedra is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:24.35,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,Wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.35,0:09:25.37,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Haughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:26.58,Default,Karr,0,0,0,,Sadistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:32.08,Default,Karr,0,0,0,,She's been obsessed with Lord Travis for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:37.30,Default,Karr,0,0,0,,I hear she's manifested herself in the human \Nrealm just to kill humans close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.73,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,She's just like Lady Tinasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.73,0:09:41.26,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,Way too attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:44.40,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'd never kill my romantic rivals!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:52.11,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Looks like she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:10:00.42,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,So you're the pesky insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:04.04,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,You should be honored to die by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:06.83,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Travis, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:21.41,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Is this... the old capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.43,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:24.14,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:26.60,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,So sneaky and annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:30.86,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Itz, Senn, Saiha, Lilia, Kunai, Eir, Sylpha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:35.04,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Work together to prevent \Nany magic from escaping the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:45.62,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:46.53,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.53,0:10:48.76,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm ready to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:50.58,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Come at me as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:52.09,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,What nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:04.26,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Travis disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:05.55,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.55,0:11:09.48,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,He said he'd be back soon, \Nbut he still hasn't returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:14.18,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,I thought Queen Tinasha \Nmight know where he went,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.18,0:11:16.44,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,but she was nowhere \Nto be found in Tuldarr, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:19.15,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha's gone missing as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.55,0:11:22.54,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,They say she was in her office until noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:27.37,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,There were burn marks in her office, \Nwhich could be a sign of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.28,0:11:30.76,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,She got involved with that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:34.26,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm going to go pay Tuldarr a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:36.40,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll inspect the fortress at a later date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:37.18,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:39.05,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,I-I'll go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:41.25,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,I'm a mage, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:42.76,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Please take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:44.24,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:54.11,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,As a mage, you'll be defending yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.36,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:11:59.28,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:03.03,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:13.45,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oscar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.33,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,Oh? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:17.52,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:20.02,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Just felt a little sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.02,0:12:22.76,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something happened to \Nthe defensive barrier I put on Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.76,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,Then slumber eternally!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:26.16,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}But right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.93,0:12:33.49,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,How unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:37.41,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,Before he has his way \Nwith that tender body of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:39.86,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,I'll butcher you until not \Na single drop of blood remains!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.45,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll have faith in Oscar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:47.72,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's been chasing after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.62,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you must not make contact!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:51.66,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Let us teleport for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:01.38,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,I'll look into that child's past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.64,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,I may be able to find a way \Nto dispel that miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.59,0:13:06.98,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll buy you time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:10.07,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,I gaze upon days gone by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:19.31,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:22.40,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Do you know the name Simila?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:23.42,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:25.88,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's the forbidden curse that Cezar summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:31.12,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I think its core was negative human emotions, \Nand it draws its power from another realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:33.98,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,That baby was sent to assassinate Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:37.58,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,with unshapen remnants \Nof Simila sealed within him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:39.66,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Evil that lacks composition...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:41.14,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Negative emotions...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:44.55,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,That must be why it wasn't detected by magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:48.48,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,There's a mark on his body \Nto bind the remnants to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:49.73,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,If you destroy it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:51.55,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,We can sever the connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:53.93,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.81,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,{\i1}She hasn't rushed here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:14:01.73,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means she's in no position to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:02.77,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.79,0:14:26.84,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,You sure did turn out to be a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:29.64,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,I must say, how fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:40.63,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,There's only one person \Nwho holds the privilege of killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:43.74,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:57.08,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,This is the end for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:07.04,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,It's all the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.95,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,Resentment...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:11.36,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,Resignation, anguish...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:13.42,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,All the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:15.39,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,All connected...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:16.90,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.88,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Negative human emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:22.56,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,The sorrow will never subside...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:24.80,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,Become one...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:30.52,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Spare me that rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:32.36,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm different from all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:42.92,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:44.38,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Bear with it, just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:52.59,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Please show me your wounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:58.24,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You should tend to him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:15:59.12,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.85,0:16:00.98,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.34,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:10.29,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.50,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:13.22,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't tell such obvious lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:14.82,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Where's that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.59,0:16:17.77,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Travis hasn't come back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:20.06,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.79,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,You know I'd never lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:24.00,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Be a little more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.46,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Travis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:26.91,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Where have you been?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:28.51,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,I've been worried sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:31.17,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I'm just fine, so no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:34.69,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If you're fine, I wish you \Nwould have helped out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:35.83,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:39.79,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Well, it's a long story...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.89,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You can tell me all about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:46.35,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,So, does that wrap up this case, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.37,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:48.89,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I'll keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:52.82,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,That said, looks like you took a real beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.24,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.59,0:17:01.20,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,A bonus for making you take on Phaedra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:05.30,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go home, Aurelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.34,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,You deceived me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.57,Default,Phaedra,0,0,0,,It was that little brat, not this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.55,0:17:14.51,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.47,0:17:17.93,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:19.29,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,An aftershock?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:24.92,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:27.31,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,There's no place here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:28.91,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:30.45,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:32.29,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Did someone possess her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:34.30,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Phaedra is nothing more than remnants now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:35.78,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,She can't possibly possess anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:40.92,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,But the demon realm is out of equilibrium \Nafter suddenly losing its queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:43.50,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,We're seeing the aftershocks \Nas it tries to return to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:44.87,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Aftershocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:48.22,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,It's trying to have her \Nreplace the queen she killed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:50.46,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,by infusing her with tremendous power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:56.42,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,But no matter how high your magic tolerance \Nis, you'll go berserk if you're subjected to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:03.62,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:06.20,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:08.77,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:11.48,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Can't we stop it somehow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:14.23,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Once she's like that, there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:20.52,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:24.20,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Akashia may have the advantage, \Nbut blind faith in it will get you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:26.18,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can't let her run loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:27.36,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,She's my woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:33.09,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,We need to talk, Tinasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:35.55,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No. Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:38.62,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,If you hate me so much, come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:40.01,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll take you on in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.33,0:18:41.99,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Then perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:46.39,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Get down here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:54.90,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:58.82,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Come back to your senses, Tinasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:18:59.78,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:04.55,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Just disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:09.06,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I-I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:10.70,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I hate you, I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:13.33,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I hate you, I hate you, I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:14.27,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:15.58,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:18.23,Default-Top,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}There should be no reason for me to be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:17.24,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:18.53,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Just die, you big liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:19.87,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I hate you, I hate you, I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:20.80,Default-Top,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why do you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:23.01,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Because I'm mortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:24.62,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.18,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:27.47,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I hate you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:31.13,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want you so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:32.44,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.70,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You won't ever be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:37.15,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You're going to leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:38.75,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I won't leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:40.74,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm yours to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:42.88,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:46.50,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}What I want is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:49.02,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Love me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:57.44,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Have you been worried about that all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:20:00.14,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I really do love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.03,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:16.22,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.22,0:20:17.94,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Don't undo the seal without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.35,0:20:20.03,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Sneaking out of the mansion as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:21.38,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,You little rascal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:23.08,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Then let me say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:26.99,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,If you want to continue \Nto spend your life with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:28.96,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,stop it with those wicked acts of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:32.72,Default,Aurelia,0,0,0,,Do that, and I'll bear half of \Nyour outrageous sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:35.06,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:36.50,Default,Travis,0,0,0,,You'll only end up unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:45.01,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,First off, why did you volunteer \Nyourself for such a painful task?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:46.87,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:49.86,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm indebted to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:53.89,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He's the one who suggested \NI put myself in that magic slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.53,0:21:00.99,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I hadn't \Neven considered the idea
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:02.90,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,of coming here to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:06.79,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,We come from different eras, \Nand there was no guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:12.37,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Until Travis told me, \N"Stop moping and go find him."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.59,0:21:16.96,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That said, we're even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.31,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.23,0:21:21.39,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:30.79,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:34.58,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I really do love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.01,0:21:36.78,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I was lying when I said, "I hate you."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:38.64,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:42.70,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,{\i1}The seeds are sown in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:48.89,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hazily, as though in a dream, \Nthey all subtly begin to take root.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.15,0:21:54.01,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,{\i1}And when they see the radiant flowers blooming,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.01,0:21:56.43,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,{\i1}that is when they \Nwill finally realize, all too late...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.77,0:22:01.30,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,{\i1}That the final upheaval has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.47,0:23:40.02,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}~ Pride of the Past ~
